# Garrison Excavator: "leave YOUR graveyard". Turn 1: four Moxen pay the Excavator and a Mountain pays a Ghost Vacuum. On turn 2 Bot2
# casts Faithless Looting (discarding two Islands) and in Bot2's second main phase the Vacuum exiles an Island from BOT2's graveyard:
# a card left a graveyard, but not Bot1's, so there is no Spirit - the battlefield stays the Excavator, the Vacuum, four Moxen and
# a Mountain, seven permanents.

[Bot1 Deck]
Garrison Excavator
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Ghost Vacuum
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Garrison Excavator.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Island; Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Bot2.Graveyard.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 7
